sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Board as Cutover Board
    participant FU as FU CRM
    participant RB as RB CRM
    participant INT as Integration Layer
    participant MDM as MDM Customer Hub
    participant CON as Canary Consumers
    participant OBS as Monitoring

    Board->>FU: Enable limited freeze
    Board->>RB: Enable limited freeze
    Board->>MDM: Freeze rules and create snapshot
    FU->>INT: Final delta and watermark
    RB->>INT: Final delta and watermark
    INT->>MDM: Idempotent delta load
    MDM->>MDM: Match, merge and survivorship
    MDM-->>Board: Reconciliation evidence

    alt Hard gates are green
        Board->>INT: Enable canary route
        CON->>INT: Customer identity request
        INT->>MDM: Read golden record
        MDM-->>CON: Global ID and source links
        CON-->>OBS: Smoke-test metrics
        OBS-->>Board: Canary is healthy
        Board->>INT: Enable full production route
        FU->>INT: New customer change
        RB->>INT: New customer change
        INT->>MDM: Continuous events
        MDM-->>CON: Golden-record events
        OBS-->>Board: Hypercare status
        Board->>FU: Release freeze
        Board->>RB: Release freeze
    else No-Go or rollback trigger
        Board->>INT: Stop golden-record publication
        INT->>CON: Restore previous read route
        FU->>INT: Continue journaling changes
        RB->>INT: Continue journaling changes
        Board->>MDM: Preserve evidence and undo defective merges
        OBS-->>Board: Reconciliation backlog
    end
